Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Want a diary that talks back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Want a diary that knows you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:05.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Well, now you have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:07.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Smart Goal Tracker\Nisn’t just a calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:09.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,It works with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,It knows about you and constantly updates\Nits understanding of who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,and what you are trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:19.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,It remembers what you have said,\Nknows how you have grown,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:21.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and knows how you can\Noptimize yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:23.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take the Interactive Diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You write in your diary—\Nand it writes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it’s smart because it knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Smart Goal Tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,How can we make your life easier?
